Bob Palmeri, played by Michael Cimino.

9
00:41:28,695 --> 00:41:34,695
Annabelle "Bee" Mullins, played by Samara Lee.

10
00:46:05,217 --> 00:46:11,217
Lorraine Warren, played by Vera Farmiga.

11
00:50:41,739 --> 00:50:47,739
Annabelle Comes Home is a 2019 American supernatural horror film written and directed by Gary Dauberman, in his
directorial debut, from a story by Dauberman and James Wan, who also served as producer with Peter Safran.

12
00:55:18,260 --> 00:55:24,260
It serves as a sequel to 2014's Annabelle and 2017's Annabelle: Creation, and
as the sixth installment in The Conjuring Universe franchise.

13
00:59:54,782 --> 01:00:00,782
The film stars Mckenna Grace, Madison Iseman, and Katie Sarife, along with Vera Farmiga
and Patrick Wilson, who reprise their roles as Ed and Lorraine Warren.

14
01:04:31,304 --> 01:04:37,304
In early April 2018, Warner Bros.

15
01:09:07,826 --> 01:09:13,826
Pictures announced that a then-untitled film in The Conjuring
Universe franchise would be released on July 3, 2019.

16
01:13:44,347 --> 01:13:50,347
Later that month, it was announced that the film would be another installment in the Annabelle series, with Dauberman signed on
to write and direct the film in his directorial debut, based on a story treatment written by Dauberman and Wan.

17
01:18:20,869 --> 01:18:26,869
Principal photography had begun by mid-October and was
finished in December 2018 in Los Angeles.

18
01:22:57,391 --> 01:23:03,391
Annabelle Comes Home was theatrically released in the
United States on June 26, 2019, by Warner Bros.

19
01:27:33,913 --> 01:27:39,913
Pictures and New Line Cinema.

20
01:32:10,434 --> 01:32:16,434
It grossed $231.3 million worldwide and received mixed reviews from critics.

21
01:36:46,956 --> 01:36:52,956
The film explores themes of supernatural, halloween, babysitter, priest, doll.

22
01:41:23,478 --> 01:41:29,478
The tone is dark.
